  "label": "User projected onto the goblin-like figure",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the goblin-like figure (goblin_like_figure) as the target of the meme's dehumanizing metaphor. The meme implies the user (or the viewer's perspective) is identifying with or judging Erdoğan as monstrous, by projecting the user's contempt or hatred onto the visual entity. The textual material 'apparently not erdogan' directs the user to interpret the visual entity as Erdoğan, thereby projecting the user's stance onto the figure.",
